WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:03,020
People bring it, you can do with it as you wish

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,020
They are in control now

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:07,020
can make them do anything

4
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:10,840
Will you also answer any questions honestly?

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:15,030
Under mental control, you won’t lie.

6
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,030
Why do you come to my mother and me?

7
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:19,030
I know Yuru has a habit of hoarding food

8
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:21,030
And he is soft-hearted and will not reject me

9
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:23,030
This is the same bed with me

10
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:25,030
If you have lived for twenty years and don’t have enough supplies,

11
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:27,530
Will you kill me and my mother?

12
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:30,040
You can give up on me easily

13
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:33,200
Hongqiang, have you ever loved me?

14
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,580
Then I'll marry you

15
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,580
Because you have a simple mind and good family conditions

16
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,580
is my best choice

17
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,620
Chen Yuru Chen Yuru

18
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:41,620
You've been such a stupid joke for twenty years

19
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,610
Then you return it to Sun Yan
